          "fields": {
            "display_title": "The authors propose a futurue video prediction model based on recurrent 3D-CNNs and propose a novel memory mechanism (Eidetic Memory) to capture long term relationships inside the recurrent layer itself. They obtain surpass the state of the art on two commonly used, (relatively) simple benchmark video prediction datasets. They further apply their model to early action recognition, performing an ablation study to evaluate the strengths of each model building block.",
